title: The Slave Markets of the Rim
subtitle: A report on Hutt slavery shocks the Core.
tags: event
view-if: date >= 30 and not slavery_abolished
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_rim.svg
on-arrival: slavery_campaign += 0.5

= The Slave Markets of the Rim

A Judicial Department report leaks to the HoloNet. It documents the slave markets of Hutt space in clinical detail: millions bought and sold, many with explosive chips implanted to stop them escaping. The Republic has always looked away, because the Hutts are useful and the Rim is far away.

- @publicise: Make it the Caucus's cause.
- @quiet: Pursue it through quiet diplomacy.

@publicise
subtitle: Faith rises, the Rim notices; the Hutts retaliate.
on-arrival: faith += 1; rim_relation += 4; slavery_campaign += 0.5; rim_hardship += 1; rimward_dissent -= 4

The Caucus reads the report into the Senate record, every page of it. It takes three days.

@quiet
subtitle: Avoids trouble; changes little.
on-arrival: guild_relation += 2; rimward_dissent += 3

Quiet diplomacy secures the release of a few hundred slaves. The markets carry on.
